---
// Who Cupola talks to: your own services, directly, two third parties for one
// thing each, and on Android Google, through the code scanner's ML Kit. The box
// in the middle is the server Cupola does not have.
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<figure class="reach">
  <div class="node you">
    <Mark size={44} file="cupola_launcher" />
    <div>
      <p class="name">Cupola</p>
      <p class="t-meta">on your phone, tablet or Mac</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wire" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span class="t-micro">at home, over your VPN or your proxy</span></div>

  <div class="node server">
    <p class="name">Your server</p>
    <ul class="mono">
      <li><span class="dot green"></span>radarr.lan:7878</li>
      <li><span class="dot green"></span>sonarr.lan:8989</li>
      <li><span class="dot green"></span>seerr.example.net</li>
      <li><span class="dot green"></span>nas.home.arpa</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="none">
    <Icon name="lock" size={18} />
    <p><b>A Cupola server</b> <span>There isn't one, so your data has nowhere else to go.</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="third tmdb">
    <p class="mono">image.tmdb.org</p>
    <p class="t-meta">Posters and cast photos, no credentials</p>
  </div>
  <div class="third plex">
    <p class="mono">plex.tv</p>
    <p class="t-meta">Once, only for a Plex sign-in to Seerr</p>
  </div>
  <div class="third google">
    <p class="mono">Google</p>
    <p class="t-meta">Android only: the code scanner's usage data</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="sr-only">
    Cupola connects directly to your own services. There is no Cupola server. The other hosts it reaches are
    TMDB's image CDN for artwork, plex.tv once if you sign in to Seerr with a Plex account, and on Android Google,
    which receives usage data from the code scanner.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .reach {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(120px, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-areas:
      'you wire server'
      'none none none'
      'tmdb google plex';
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .node {
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: var(--r-slab);
    background: rgb(18 18 24 / 0.86);
    border: 1px solid var(--edge);
  }
  .you {
    grid-area: you;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .server {
    grid-area: server;
  }
  .name {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-variation-settings: 'wdth' 92, 'opsz' 22;
  }
  .server ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .server li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .wire {
    grid-area: wire;
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .wire i {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--light) 20%, var(--light) 80%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px color-mix(in srgb, var(--light) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .none {
    grid-area: none;
    justify-self: center;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    max-width: 520px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--r-door);
    border: 1px dashed rgb(255 255 255 / 0.2);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .none :global(svg) {
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex: none;
  }
  .none b {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .none span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .third {
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--r-door);
    border: 1px solid var(--hair);
    background: rgb(18 18 24 / 0.5);
  }
  .third .mono {
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .tmdb {
    grid-area: tmdb;
  }
  .plex {
    grid-area: plex;
  }
  .google {
    grid-area: google;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .reach {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-areas: 'you' 'wire' 'server' 'none' 'tmdb' 'plex' 'google';
    }
    .wire i {
      width: 2px;
      height: 56px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--light) 20%, var(--light) 80%, transparent);
    }
  }
</style>
